        "original_id": "9bbe74cf-4992-510b-9e2a-aded2e083241",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: The Hand That Feeds, Closer, Hurt\n- Band: Nine Inch Nails\n- Albums: The Downward Spiral\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100\n- Topics: crossover hits, pop radio\n\nFacts:\n- In 1994, Nine Inch Nails released \"Closer\" on their second studio album, \"The Downward Spiral.\"\n- In 1994 and 1995, \"Closer\" and \"Hurt\" were Nine Inch Nails' top 40 radio hits before \"The Hand That Feeds.\"\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" crossed over to pop radio as a crossover hit for Nine Inch Nails.\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" became Nine Inch Nails' first top 40 radio hit since \"Closer\" and \"Hurt.\"\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" peaked at number 31 on the Billboard Hot 100 chart.",
